hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3013","**
Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Yahya, narrated to us Sa‘id ibn Sulayman, narrated to us ‘Abdullah ibn al-Mu‘ammal, narrated to us ‘Umar ibn ‘Abd al-Rahman ibn Muhaysin, on the authority of ‘Ata’, on the authority of Ibn ‘Abbas (RA) who said:

The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, “Whoever enters the House (the Ka‘bah) enters in a good deed, and exits from an evil deed, forgiven.”

---"
